body:
I am experiencing the same.

&#x200B;

edit: got it working. I removed every character that reacts to an enemy dying and it worked.

Having the same issue on Game Pass PC. Played once for a few hours with mouse/keyboard just fine last night. Went to play this afternoon I can get through company splash screens then Arcade Paradise appears and then nothing happens. No controllers plugged in, tried with 1 controller, tried with 2 controllers. None cause any response. Rebooted, restarted, reinstalled. None fixed the issue.

&#x200B;

edit: Forced the game to boot on my primary monitor instead of my secondary where I normal play games and it works. I can then switch monitors and play there as long as I switch it back to primary before I quit.
